       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          TTSTNUM.
       AUTHOR.              CRAIG HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        MAR 1, 1991.
       DATE-COMPILED.
       INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **  THIS IS USED TO TEST VARIOUS EDIT CODES, CHECK(RZ),    **
      *D  ETC ON THE ZTSTNUM SCREEN.                             **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZTSTNUM-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.

       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC        PIC X(1500).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  NOTHING-ENTRY      PIC X(1).
       01  EDITED-QTY         PIC Z(6)9.9(4).
      *************************************************************
      *             C A L L E D   R O U T I N E S                 *
      *************************************************************
       COPY HMSGBUF    IN COPYLIB.
       01  FIELD-NUMBER                  PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 1.

       COPY FUNCTDEF   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TSHWRDFM   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDAT2   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY VCOMAREA   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGUAGE   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD    IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      *              S C R E E N   B U F F E R S                  *
      *************************************************************
      *----------  PURCHASE ORDER WORKAREA
       01  DE-FIELDS-1.
           05  DE-QTY-X                  PIC X(12).
           05  DE-QTY REDEFINES DE-QTY-X PIC 9(8)V9(4).
           05  DE-COMMAND-LINE-1         PIC X(79).
           05  DE-MESSAGE-LINE-1         PIC X(79).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-START.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.
           PERFORM 6000-MAIN THRU 6990-MAIN-X.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE.
           DISPLAY "THE VALUE FROM THE SCREEN IS ",
             DE-QTY-X.
           DISPLAY "HIT ENTER TO CONTINUE".
           ACCEPT NOTHING-ENTRY.
           GOBACK.

       6000-MAIN.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO  DE-FIELDS-1.
           MOVE "TESTNUM"                TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXTFORM.

           MOVE 8                        TO  SRF-KEYSET.
           MOVE "I"                      TO  SRF-FKEY (7).
           MOVE 2.5 TO EDITED-QTY.
           MOVE EDITED-QTY TO DE-QTY-X.
           PERFORM  9999-DO-SCREEN-1.
       6990-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.


      *------ THIS VERSION OF CATREAD ASSUMES THE SET/MSG NUMBER
      *------ WILL BE IN CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER.
       999-CATREAD.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           IF MESSAGE-BUFFER-1  = SPACES
               MOVE "* ERROR ON THIS FIELD *" TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       COPY SCRNCALL IN COPYLIB.
       COPY SCRNCL1  IN COPYLIB.
